[27.740264, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /app && cp model_ref.xml model.xml && python eval.py\r\nFinal state difference: 0.0000\r\nAvg simulation time: 0.2647 secs\r\nAvg simulation time (ref): 0.2650 secs\r\nSpeedup: 1.00x\r\nTime pctg: 1.00\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/app/eval.py\", line 88, in <module>\r\n    test_model_speed()\r\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\r\n  File \"/app/eval.py\", line 81, in test_model_speed\r\n    assert act_time_pctg <= pctg, (\r\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\nAssertionError: Time pctg 99.87% (need 60.00%)\r\n"]
